Lanette: Oh! {0100:0}!{be01}
I’m sorry everything is so cluttered...
When I get engrossed in research,{be00}
things end up this way...{be01}
This is embarrassing... Please keep
this a secret in exchange for this.

真由美的研究注释。
关于盒子的信息。{be01}
每个盒子可以保管30只宝可梦。{be01}
每个训练家可以在电脑
系统里保管420只宝可梦。{be01}
继续阅读吗？

标记系统是为了用来
使宝可梦更容易被管理。{be01}
每个盒子的壁纸和名字
都是用来使被保管的{be00}
宝可梦更开心。{be01}
继续阅读吗？

当存放宝可梦时，它会被送往
你最后所使用的盒子里。{be01}
如果那个盒子满了的话
宝可梦就会被送到下一个盒子。{be01}
也就是说，检查盒子后
系统会自动选择存放{be00}
宝可梦的盒子。

Lanette: Oh, {0100:0}! Congratulations
on becoming the Champion!{be01}
Bill, a friend in Kanto who made the
PC Storage System there, sent me this.{be01}
It’s a ticket for a ship to Navel Rock,
a rock far out at sea. They say rare{be00}
Pokémon rest deep inside it.{be01}
I’m far too busy with my PC work.
Why don’t you go? Please, take it!
